# Boseiju, Who Endures, channel: "This ability costs {1} less to activate for each legendary creature you control" - a
# cost reduction takes away generic mana only (CR 601.2f), so with two legendary creatures (Ragavan and Ajani, Nacatl
# Pariah) {1}{G} becomes {G}, not nothing: the Mox Emerald alone pays and the pool is empty afterwards. A cost reduced
# below its coloured part would leave the mana in the pool. (The one-legend case is the existing scenario, and no legend is
# the decline scenario: the full {1}{G}.)

